                 body="<p>A [[convolution]] slides a small learned [[filter]] over the image. A [[CNN]]'s first-layer filters start as noise and end up as edge and color detectors. On the laptop tier your CNN beats HOG + [[SVM]] by more than ten points on CIFAR-10 in about two minutes.</p>",
