                 lore="The meme: a pretrained LLM drawn as a tentacled Lovecraftian \"shoggoth\" wearing a small smiley-face mask labeled RLHF. Earlier, Yann LeCun had described learning as a cake where reinforcement learning is just the cherry on top. RLHF is, roughly, that cherry.",
